WEBVTT

00:05.370 --> 00:06.840
Man...

00:06.840 --> 00:09.630
This might turn out to be a real storm.

00:12.210 --> 00:16.510
A snide remark regarding Suguru's betrayal?

00:16.510 --> 00:18.780
No, of course not.

00:19.610 --> 00:24.750
However, if you leave the
Onikirimaru as it is,

00:24.750 --> 00:27.520
in the worst case scenario, it may lead to the end of the world.

00:27.520 --> 00:31.580
Even if you're all right with that, it poses a problem for us.

00:33.460 --> 00:35.560
But if you have a plan,

00:35.560 --> 00:39.400
the Bureau won't hesitate to help.

00:39.400 --> 00:41.530
I never said I was all right with that.

01:05.060 --> 01:07.060
When did I first notice

01:07.060 --> 01:09.060
That your fingers were

01:09.060 --> 01:12.730
So beautiful

01:13.030 --> 01:16.730
And when did I notice this feeling?

01:17.070 --> 01:20.040
So fast that I'll be run over

01:20.040 --> 01:22.680
I cannot keep up

01:22.680 --> 01:26.010
My fearful heart

01:26.010 --> 01:28.750
Puts on the brakes

01:29.180 --> 01:31.550
Our eyes meet

01:32.420 --> 01:33.560
We talk about something

01:33.560 --> 01:36.750
When you look at me

01:37.060 --> 01:41.460
I cannot move

01:43.100 --> 01:50.770
My beating heart is about to break

01:51.070 --> 01:55.040
The arms that catch me pull me

01:55.040 --> 01:59.080
I can't suppress it, I can't express it

01:59.080 --> 02:03.750
That I like you

02:04.090 --> 02:07.060
So much it hurts

02:07.060 --> 02:14.760
The beginning of a love that won't let me breathe

02:19.670 --> 02:22.600
The Traitor's Vow

02:26.910 --> 02:29.380
If you don't come inside soon, you'll get sick.

02:30.280 --> 02:31.610
Ashiya.

02:32.350 --> 02:35.440
Or are you out here praying to the gods?

02:38.590 --> 02:42.090
Either the Tamayori princess must be powerless,

02:42.090 --> 02:46.030
or you're all not considered worth much.

02:46.030 --> 02:47.460
What do you mean?

02:50.700 --> 02:54.500
I heard that Ohmi has defected to Logos.

02:57.440 --> 02:59.910
Unfortunately, he was too wise.

03:00.480 --> 03:03.270
That's probably why he went with Logos.

03:03.880 --> 03:07.080
Are you saying that we're wrong?

03:07.350 --> 03:09.410
No, no. That's not it.

03:12.990 --> 03:15.320
I believe I explained it to you in the beginning.

03:15.320 --> 03:17.160
We, the Bureau of Medicine,

03:17.160 --> 03:19.150
are an organization that supervises the gods.

03:21.200 --> 03:26.000
I'd be in trouble, too, if Logos walked off with the Onikirimaru.

03:26.000 --> 03:29.940
That's why I help you and want you to do your best.

03:33.310 --> 03:37.610
The Bureau has information that you don't have.

03:37.910 --> 03:40.940
That by itself is a big advantage.

03:41.520 --> 03:44.510
I think we could work well together.

03:46.250 --> 03:47.650
Excuse me.

03:49.020 --> 03:52.230
Really, now. Ohmi isn't coming back, you know.

03:52.230 --> 03:53.860
He's a traitor.

03:55.930 --> 03:58.460
Have you ever been betrayed?

03:59.900 --> 04:03.500
You're wrong. Suguru had a reason.

04:03.500 --> 04:04.770
A reason?

04:04.770 --> 04:06.110
If he had a reason,

04:06.110 --> 04:08.080
then why didn't he say anything to you?

04:09.740 --> 04:12.210
I guess he really didn't trust you.

04:13.950 --> 04:17.750
The truth is, you should already know.

04:18.550 --> 04:19.920
We don't know.

04:25.690 --> 04:28.730
I'll have you stop badmouthing Ohmi.

04:28.730 --> 04:30.900
Badmouthing? Unthinkable.

04:30.900 --> 04:32.730
I only spoke the truth.

04:32.730 --> 04:35.940
The reason Ohmi didn't say anything to us...

04:35.940 --> 04:38.810
was because Ohmi had something else in mind.

04:38.810 --> 04:41.210
You have no right to talk about him like that.

04:41.910 --> 04:43.970
How deep does your trust run?

04:44.650 --> 04:46.710
Do you really like Ohmi that much?

04:46.710 --> 04:51.380
I prefer the "traitor" Ohmi over someone shady like you.

04:53.490 --> 04:56.390
Goodness... How tiresome.

04:57.260 --> 04:58.330
Go home.

04:58.330 --> 05:01.260
You aren't suited for a guardian's job.

05:02.200 --> 05:05.220
I get it. I'll leave for today.

05:09.500 --> 05:10.270
Tamaki.

05:12.640 --> 05:14.770
Say hello to the predecessor for me.

05:23.620 --> 05:24.240
Hey!

05:25.290 --> 05:26.280
Sorry...

05:27.290 --> 05:28.220
It's all right.

05:32.630 --> 05:34.600
I promise, it's all right.

05:36.800 --> 05:39.100
Thank you, Takuma.

05:51.980 --> 05:53.570
Until now, and from now on,

05:54.550 --> 05:57.610
we are the five guardians of the Tamayori princess.

06:11.570 --> 06:12.860
I told you already.

06:15.470 --> 06:18.410
Aria will not see you.

06:19.210 --> 06:20.710
But I'm begging you!

06:20.710 --> 06:22.610
I want her to hear my story!

06:23.480 --> 06:25.040
Otherwise, we'll...

06:26.980 --> 06:28.920
Didn't you promise?

06:28.920 --> 06:32.150
Just once. I don't mind just meeting once!

06:43.430 --> 06:45.330
If you won't listen,

06:45.830 --> 06:47.500
then I'll have to use force.

06:48.240 --> 06:49.440
Stop.

06:49.440 --> 06:51.340
You're the one who will get hurt.

06:57.110 --> 06:59.340
If you meet her, will you give up?

07:26.440 --> 07:27.810
That woman...

07:27.810 --> 07:30.080
Knowing that I'm watching her...

07:30.080 --> 07:31.100
I've been underestimated.

07:35.650 --> 07:39.950
Fine. If you're provoking me, I'll bite.

07:45.830 --> 07:47.760
Wh-What's this?

07:48.130 --> 07:51.070
Isn't tonight's dinner a little too amazing?

07:51.070 --> 07:52.470
It's amazing.

07:55.300 --> 07:57.470
It seems Shinji hasn't returned yet.

08:01.080 --> 08:03.480
What is he doing?

08:05.910 --> 08:07.470
He's probably...

08:08.050 --> 08:10.320
trying to calm his nerves.

08:10.320 --> 08:12.080
Now, everyone.

08:12.820 --> 08:15.120
Please go ahead and dig in.

08:21.300 --> 08:23.230
Hey, Mitsuru?

08:24.300 --> 08:25.530
I forgot.

08:25.530 --> 08:28.130
I made some boiled radish and spare rib, too.

08:32.370 --> 08:35.830
Even I could never eat all that...

08:39.150 --> 08:42.680
But that's just Mitsuru's way of showing she cares.

08:42.680 --> 08:44.250
Telling us to cheer up.

08:44.250 --> 08:45.120
Yeah.

08:45.120 --> 08:46.690
<i>And maybe also because...</i>

08:46.690 --> 08:49.710
<i>of what happened between her and Shinji.</i>

08:51.790 --> 08:53.450
Would you give me some time alone?

08:58.200 --> 08:59.460
All right!

08:59.730 --> 09:01.790
All this great food will get cold.

09:02.300 --> 09:05.240
I feel bad for Shinji, but let's start eating.

09:05.740 --> 09:07.110
You're right.

09:08.880 --> 09:10.670
That's what we should do.

09:11.580 --> 09:13.250
Then let's eat!
<i>That's right.</i>

09:13.250 --> 09:16.270
<i>Mitsuru's doing her best to put a smile on.</i>

09:18.220 --> 09:19.450
<i>I have to, too.</i>

09:21.720 --> 09:23.520
Let's eat!

09:29.430 --> 09:31.990
Man, did I eat.

09:32.270 --> 09:33.530
Yeah.

09:33.770 --> 09:35.770
I can't eat any more.

09:35.770 --> 09:36.970
Yeah.

09:41.510 --> 09:43.310
What's wrong, Tamaki?

09:44.780 --> 09:46.580
Just getting some air.

09:51.920 --> 09:55.410
I wonder if Shinji's all right.

10:22.320 --> 10:24.910
Quiet. I hate loud women.

10:26.350 --> 10:27.660
What are you doing?

10:27.660 --> 10:30.160
This is way past sexual harassment!

10:30.160 --> 10:31.630
What happened to Inukai?

10:32.260 --> 10:34.250
What, don't you know?

10:37.000 --> 10:41.300
I bet you didn't know that Inukai was a pawn for Logos, either.

10:43.170 --> 10:47.680
That female teacher called herself Fiona at school,

10:47.680 --> 10:50.470
but that Logos woman was in contact with him.

10:51.110 --> 10:51.980
You're lying.

10:51.750 --> 10:52.710
It's not a lie.

10:53.350 --> 10:57.050
Right now he's with Logos.

10:57.990 --> 11:02.080
But Shinji was the one who told us about Suguru.

11:02.620 --> 11:04.490
<i>What's going on with those two?</i>

11:05.160 --> 11:07.460
<i>Does that mean one of them is lying?</i>

11:10.670 --> 11:14.070
It's true that they are both working for Logos.

11:14.070 --> 11:18.100
Apparently the truth about
Ohmi was a shock to Inukai.

11:18.940 --> 11:21.840
He probably thought that his job was at risk.

11:21.840 --> 11:25.300
In terms of strength and intelligence,
Ohmi is far superior.

11:25.850 --> 11:28.980
And so he panicked and reported it.

11:28.980 --> 11:31.680
Just the cowardly move I'd expect from him.

11:34.060 --> 11:36.150
I'll tell you one more thing.

11:36.460 --> 11:40.690
Your current situation is worse than you think.

11:42.730 --> 11:45.700
But you refuse to notice it and just act like nothing's wrong!

11:47.000 --> 11:49.840
Watching you pisses me off!

11:51.610 --> 11:52.870
Something stinks.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.870
Smells like a wild beast.

11:56.010 --> 11:57.950
I know you're there.

12:02.880 --> 12:05.010
If you have business, enter from the front.

12:08.590 --> 12:10.580
I have no business with you.

12:19.600 --> 12:20.190
Wa-

12:26.740 --> 12:27.980
Yuichi.

12:27.980 --> 12:29.440
Tamaki, here.

12:35.920 --> 12:37.550
Yuichi.

12:37.550 --> 12:40.280
I'm going to look for
Shinji and Ohmi.

12:41.590 --> 12:43.190
Right now?

12:43.190 --> 12:44.890
We'll tell Mahiro and Takuma later.

12:45.560 --> 12:47.730
If I told them this now,

12:47.730 --> 12:49.200
they wouldn't be able to stay calm.

12:58.640 --> 12:59.500
Not yet.

13:00.040 --> 13:01.700
Not until we know everything.

13:03.740 --> 13:04.470
Yes.

13:15.060 --> 13:17.460
Be careful, there's a step here.

13:17.460 --> 13:18.220
Yes.

13:20.060 --> 13:22.100
You're amazing, Yuichi.

13:22.100 --> 13:23.590
Even without light...

13:25.630 --> 13:29.590
I have a beast's blood in my veins, so I can see at night.

13:30.910 --> 13:31.640
I..

13:31.640 --> 13:32.940
No, it's fine.

13:33.710 --> 13:34.510
Tamaki.

13:34.510 --> 13:35.740
Uh, yes?

13:36.080 --> 13:37.650
Up until now,

13:37.650 --> 13:40.270
have you ever sensed anything from Shinji?

13:42.980 --> 13:45.150
I didn't sense it, exactly, but...

13:49.660 --> 13:50.990
I'm sorry.

13:50.990 --> 13:53.860
Maybe I should have said something earlier.

13:53.860 --> 13:56.160
No, there's nothing to apologize for.

13:56.160 --> 13:58.670
Did you notice something, too, Yuichi?

13:58.670 --> 13:59.600
Yes.

14:00.170 --> 14:04.970
First was when Logos immediately knew where to find the Artifacts,

14:04.970 --> 14:08.980
too quickly and without any evidence of searching.

14:08.980 --> 14:11.780
As if they knew where to look from the beginning.

14:12.610 --> 14:14.150
You don't think...

14:14.150 --> 14:16.220
If someone hadn't told them,

14:16.220 --> 14:20.450
to be able to find and steal the Artifacts with such precision would be impossible.

14:21.020 --> 14:24.960
But we had fought together all this time.

14:25.290 --> 14:26.450
That's not all.

14:29.160 --> 14:32.930
Shinji was searching for the
Logos hideout by himself.

14:33.470 --> 14:37.840
There's something that's bothering me about where Logos might be hiding.

14:39.070 --> 14:43.270
I think that Shinji wanted to meet with Logos, to get in contact with Aria.

14:45.310 --> 14:48.480
I don't know why Logos rejected him.

14:49.050 --> 14:52.850
Whether they had no more use for him after they found the Artifacts...

14:54.420 --> 14:58.430
I should have paid closer attention to Shinji.

14:58.430 --> 15:00.660
I'm at fault for allowing him to go.

15:00.660 --> 15:01.920
That's...

15:23.450 --> 15:24.210
This is...

15:25.750 --> 15:29.360
Was there always a building like that in this village?

15:29.360 --> 15:31.760
It was probably hidden by some sort of magic.

15:33.090 --> 15:34.600
The fact that it has been dispelled...

15:34.600 --> 15:37.430
means that there must no longer be a need to hide it.

15:39.270 --> 15:42.240
Or perhaps this is a trap as well.

15:42.870 --> 15:44.240
Yuichi.

15:44.810 --> 15:46.140
Don't worry.

15:46.140 --> 15:47.980
I'm one of the guardians as well.

15:47.980 --> 15:49.740
I'll outsmart my opponent.

15:49.740 --> 15:51.180
Outsmart?

15:53.210 --> 15:57.780
It's magic. We'll become that which cannot be.

15:59.890 --> 16:01.980
Umbra Quietus.

16:15.740 --> 16:18.070
Aria will be here.

16:30.580 --> 16:32.080
Shinji?

16:32.620 --> 16:33.550
Very well.

16:34.190 --> 16:36.050
There's no need to humble yourself.

16:36.960 --> 16:39.290
Did you think you could break your promise?

16:40.290 --> 16:41.130
No.

16:42.060 --> 16:44.930
Then there should be no need for you to be here.

16:45.700 --> 16:47.130
Monado Aria...

16:47.130 --> 16:51.330
I am prepared to be the messenger of destruction.

16:51.710 --> 16:54.810
I want for you, as quickly as possible,

16:54.810 --> 16:57.540
to leave with that thing.

16:57.540 --> 16:58.810
Funf.

16:59.350 --> 17:02.320
Did you think I would listen to your demands?

17:03.950 --> 17:08.260
We only do that which must be done according to the Black Book.

17:08.260 --> 17:10.780
Until that is done, we have no intention of leaving this place.

17:13.690 --> 17:15.130
If you understand, then leave.

17:16.960 --> 17:18.190
You, too.

17:21.370 --> 17:26.330
Hidden in the wind, shrouded in darkness, show yourselves.

17:33.910 --> 17:36.480
Yuichi, Tamaki!

17:36.480 --> 17:37.850
Shinji...

17:41.690 --> 17:42.680
Wait!

17:43.990 --> 17:45.360
What is the Black Book?

17:47.800 --> 17:49.560
What is it you must do?

17:50.060 --> 17:52.370
What more will you do?

17:52.370 --> 17:54.230
The Onikirimaru is already...

17:55.370 --> 17:57.240
It is only sleeping.

17:58.570 --> 17:59.570
Sleeping?

17:59.570 --> 18:01.540
When it next awakens,

18:01.540 --> 18:04.840
the Artifact will demonstrate its complete and true power.

18:06.310 --> 18:07.950
Complete?

18:07.950 --> 18:10.120
Then take it away from here!

18:10.120 --> 18:11.720
That's what you promised!

18:11.720 --> 18:15.460
My promise with you was to spare your life.

18:15.460 --> 18:18.360
I have continued to keep that promise.

18:19.930 --> 18:23.160
But... Oh, it's too late.

18:29.400 --> 18:31.510
What were you thinking, coming here?

18:31.510 --> 18:34.480
Suguru, did you really join Logos?

18:34.480 --> 18:36.210
I believe I already told you.

18:36.210 --> 18:38.980
Why? You have a reason, don't you?

18:38.980 --> 18:40.610
Please tell me!

18:40.610 --> 18:42.280
It's simple.

18:42.280 --> 18:45.380
You cannot suppress the Onikirimaru.

18:45.850 --> 18:48.910
The guardians will fall to Logos.

18:49.560 --> 18:53.190
Obey Logos, Tamaki, Komura.

18:53.960 --> 18:56.130
That is the ideal option.

18:56.130 --> 18:59.000
You're lying. I don't believe that.

18:59.000 --> 19:00.300
Ohmi.

19:00.300 --> 19:04.900
Didn't you come here knowing that you would fall to Logos?

19:06.070 --> 19:07.700
Shall I capture them?

19:09.180 --> 19:11.580
Or eat their souls?

19:13.150 --> 19:14.450
Burn, flames!

19:20.190 --> 19:21.750
Burn them to ashes!

19:23.090 --> 19:24.150
Appear.

19:30.560 --> 19:31.960
Die!

19:34.670 --> 19:36.430
Zwei, stop.

19:37.970 --> 19:39.130
Umbra Quietus.

19:53.090 --> 19:55.320
D-Did they follow us?

19:55.320 --> 19:58.120
No, it looks like we're all right.

19:58.660 --> 19:59.790
Good.

20:02.400 --> 20:03.830
Hey!

20:04.500 --> 20:06.260
Yuichi!

20:06.800 --> 20:08.390
Tamaki!

20:09.540 --> 20:11.610
They're not here.

20:11.610 --> 20:13.700
Where did they go?

20:16.540 --> 20:17.530
A frog?

20:23.180 --> 20:24.850
Good evening.

20:25.250 --> 20:26.380
Ashiya.

20:27.350 --> 20:29.560
Didn't you two go as well?

20:29.560 --> 20:30.990
To where?

20:30.990 --> 20:34.190
To bring back the traitorous Inukai.

20:35.030 --> 20:39.030
Will Tamaki and Komura be all right by themselves?

20:39.030 --> 20:41.130
I'm a little worried.

20:42.370 --> 20:45.240
Even Ohmi alone would be too much for them.

20:45.970 --> 20:48.140
Are you all right?

21:01.020 --> 21:10.560
The red sky stains time itself as it envelops us

21:10.560 --> 21:19.300
Did you hug me back so tightly because you're worried?

21:19.910 --> 21:24.980
Tell me everything about the dream you had

21:24.980 --> 21:29.450
That you just started to say, but stopped yourself

21:29.450 --> 21:34.590
We drew each other closer with clumsy hands

21:34.590 --> 21:41.360
Let's embrace the sign guiding us to the same future

21:41.360 --> 21:50.970
Only you, only you, will I swear to love through it all

21:50.970 --> 22:00.850
So keep that smile I want to protect beside me always

22:00.850 --> 22:10.460
I'm sure it was inevitable that
I would feel your tears

22:10.460 --> 22:18.900
So I'll become a breeze that blows on your eyes

22:18.900 --> 22:24.600
I promise you

22:32.450 --> 22:34.140
What's going on, Shinji?

22:35.780 --> 22:38.980
Aren't you the one who said that Ohmi was a traitor?

22:39.420 --> 22:41.560
You're the one who told us that,

22:41.560 --> 22:45.460
so what do you mean, you've been giving information to Logos?

22:48.800 --> 22:51.990
The Onikirimaru seal was broken because of you.

22:53.770 --> 22:54.870
Say something!

22:54.870 --> 22:56.130
Stop it.

22:57.040 --> 22:59.600
Please stop, Mahiro.

23:00.070 --> 23:02.810
Let's hear Shinji's side of the story, too.

23:02.810 --> 23:03.780
Story?

23:05.380 --> 23:07.410
We're guardians.

23:07.410 --> 23:10.380
We protect the Tamayori princess and keep the Onikirimaru sealed.

23:10.850 --> 23:13.250
That's our fate. But...

23:14.220 --> 23:15.860
What each of us does,

23:15.860 --> 23:17.760
what each of us thinks,

23:17.760 --> 23:19.190
is completely different.

23:22.000 --> 23:23.290
Can you...

23:23.860 --> 23:26.660
Can you even call us guardians?!

23:39.550 --> 23:42.810
I like you, Senpai.

23:43.750 --> 23:46.740
I always want you to be smiling.

23:48.220 --> 23:49.890
If it's for that purpose,

23:49.890 --> 23:52.880
I feel like I can do anything.

23:54.690 --> 24:00.960
Next Time: The Destruction of the Five Guardian Families
